 "name": "Turkish bridge tolls (KGM)",
 "law": "Karayollarında Geçiş Ücretlerinin Belirlenmesi ve Uygulanmasına Dair Yönetmelik; KGM's 2026 tariffs of the 15 Temmuz Şehitler, Fatih Sultan Mehmet, Osmangazi, Yavuz Sultan Selim and 1915 Çanakkale bridges. Per passage, either direction, by KGM class: 2 (two axles of 3.20 m or more wheelbase), 3 (three axles), 4 (four and five axles), 5 (six or more), excluding 20% KDV (VAT). Trucks may not use 15 Temmuz Şehitler or FSM (UKOME decision) but pay their tariff if they do. Each bridge placed at its main span in OpenStreetMap (extract of 2026-11-03). The KGM and concession motorways' entry–exit tolls aren't included.",
